<rml>
<head>
	<title>Map name (CUIMapName)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="map_name.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="map_name">
	<!-- The map name banner shown on every map change (CUIMapName): the map's name image and, on a
	     Gens battle map, the strife banner right above it, fading in and out together. Physical px
	     like the original, which drew both unscaled. In the background context, behind its other
	     documents (the original drew it before every window). Takes no pointer events. -->
	<div id="banner" data-style-left="left + 'px'" data-style-top="top + 'px'" data-style-opacity="alpha">
		<img id="strife" data-if="strife" data-attr-src="strife_source"/>
		<img id="name" data-attr-src="image_source"/>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
